+        "O(q) quadratic-residue table and, at the shipping preset, was measured "
+        "on eight instances as reported by selftest; the Lemma 2.1 coordinate "
+        "calculation compresses it below 300 exact modular operations, but a "
+        "no-tool solver must discover the branch structure and execute six "
